<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ruti xa Taruxui</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruti xa Taruxui</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruti xa Taruxui</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi kitaabui findixi taruxui di nan na ginɛ firin xa fe ra. Ginɛ nde nun a xa mɔri nan keli e xɔnyi Isirayila bɔxi ma, e tunu Mowaba bɔxi ma. Mɛnni, na xɛmɛ nun a xa di xɛmɛ firinyie naxa faxa. Na kaaɲɛ ginɛ nun a xa die xa ginɛe naxa lu naa e keren setareɲa kui. A raɲɔnyi, na kaaɲɛ ginɛ naxa natɛ tongo a xa gbilen a xɔnyi. A xa mamadi Ruti naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra xanunteya xa fe ra. E to so Isirayila bɔxi ma e xa sunnunyi kui, Alatala naxa kaabanakoe nde raba naxan a masenma a tɔɔrɔmixie xanuma. A naxa mɛɛni na ginɛ firinyie ma a fanyi ra, alako e naxa lu setareɲa kui e kerenyi ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi taruxui nɔma limaniya fide to mixie ma, naxee nɔma a maɲɔxunde a Ala bara nɛɛmu e ma. Xa mixi bira Ala fɔxɔ ra, e a sago rabama, Ala mu nɛɛmuma e ma fefe ma. Tɔɔrɛ nde nɔma e lide, kɔnɔ Alatala nɔma na tɔɔrɛ mafindi fe fanyi ra. Yi taruxui fɔlɛ makinikini, kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi a Ala sɛnbɛ nun a xa xanunteya masenma won bɛ. Ala xa won mali na kolonde won ma duniɲɛigiri kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ruti xa Taruxui</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimeleki xa denbaya tunufe Mowaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Alatala xa kiitisae xa waxati, kaamɛ din nɛ Isirayila bɔxi ra. Xɛmɛ nde naxa keli Bɛtɛlɛɛmu, naxan nu na Yudaya bɔxi ma. A naxa tunu Mowaba bɔxi ma, a tan, a xa ginɛ, nun a xa di firinyie. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Na xɛmɛ xili Elimeleki, a xa ginɛ Nowemi, a xa die, Maxalɔn nun Kiliyon. E fatan Efarata xabilɛ nan ma. E naxa sa sabati Mowaba bɔxi ma.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Na tɛmui Nowemi xa mɔri Elimeleki naxa faxa. Nowemi naxa lu naa fa, a nun a xa di firinyie. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Na di firinyie naxa Mowaba ginɛe dɔxɔ. Ginɛ singe xili Oropa, a firin nde Ruti. E naxa lu mɛnni han ɲɛ fu. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Na xanbi Maxalɔn nun Kiliyon fan naxa faxa. Nowemi naxa lu naa fa a keren. Xɛmɛ mu na, di mu na.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Nowemi to a mɛ a Alatala bara a xa ɲama mali baloe fe ra, <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Nowemi nun a xa die xa ginɛ firinyie naxa keli Mowaba bɔxi ma, e nu sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ. E to kira li naxan sigama Yudaya bɔxi ma, <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Nowemi naxa a fala a xa die xa ginɛe bɛ, «Wo xa gbilen wo ngae xɔnyi. Alatala xa hinnɛ wo ra, alɔ wo a rabaxi n tan nun n ma die bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Alatala xa xɛmɛ fi wo ma, wo sabatima naxan xɔn bɔɲɛsa kui.» Nowemi naxa findigilin e ma, kinikini naxa e rawa.<verse eid="RUT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />E naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ade, na mu lanma. Won birin xa siga i bɔnsɔɛ yire.» <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Nowemi naxa e yaabi, «N ma mamadie, wo xa gbilen. Munfe ra wo wama birafe n fɔxɔ ra? N tan nɔma di gbɛtɛe baride sɔnɔn wo dɔxɔma naxee xɔn? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />N ma mamadie, fo wo xa gbilen wo xɔnyi. N bara fori. N mu nɔma xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ sɔtɔde sɔnɔn. Hali n sa xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ sɔtɔ to, n fa di bari to kɔɛ ra, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />wo nɔma na di mɛmɛde han a mɔ wo fa dɔxɔ a xɔn ma? Wo nɔma na ra? N ma mamadie, wo mu nɔma na ra. Na xɔrɔxɔ. Wo nɔma tondide xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bɛ, han n ma die mɔ? Alatala naxan nagirixi n ma, a xɔrɔxɔ dangife wo xa tɔɔrɛ ra. Alatala bara n tɔɔrɔ ki fanyi.»<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Na kui Oropa nun Ruti man naxa wa fɔlɔ. Oropa naxa findigilin Nowemi ma, a fa gbilen a xɔnyi, kɔnɔ Ruti tan naxa kankan Nowemi ma. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Nowemi naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ruti, Oropa bara gbilen a xa mixie xɔnyi. A bara gbilen a xa diinɛ ma. I tan fan, i xa bira a fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ruti naxɛ, «I naxa n karaxan n xa gbilen i fɔxɔ ra. I naxa n keri. I nu siga dɛdɛ, n fan sigama mɛnni nɛ. Won sabatima nɛ yire keren. I xa mixie findima n ma mixie nan na. I Marigi Ala findima n fan Marigi nan na. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />N luma i sɛɛti ma han i faxa, n fa ragata i xa gaburi sɛɛti ma. Xa n i bɛɲin, Alatala xa i haakɛ mini n i. Saya gbansan xa won nafatan.»<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Nowemi to a kolon, Ruti xa natɛ mu masarama, a naxa dundu. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />E firin naxa ti kira xɔn ma han Bɛtɛlɛɛmu. E to so taa kui, ɲama naxa tɛrɛnna e tofe ra. Ginɛe nu fa maxɔrinyi ti, «Nowemi nan ya?» <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Nowemi nu fa e yaabi, «N mu xilima Nowemi sɔnɔn. Wo xa n xili Mara, barima Ala Sɛnbɛma bara n ma duniɲɛigiri raxɔrɔxɔ n ma.» («Nowemi» wama a falafe nɛ «a ɲɔxun.» «Mara» wama a falafe nɛ «a xɔnɔ.») <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />«N siga sigama, n nun fe fanyi nan siga, kɔnɔ Alatala bara n nagbilen n bɛlɛxɛ igeli ra. Munfe ra wo n xilima Nowemi? Alatala Sɛnbɛma bara ti n kanke, a bara ɲaxankatɛ dɔxɔ n ma.»<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Nowemi gbilen a xɔnyi na ki nɛ, a tan nun a xa di xa ginɛ Ruti Mowabaka. E soxi Bɛtɛlɛɛmu funden maniyɛ xaba tɛmui nɛ.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Boosu Ruti malife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Sɛnbɛma nde nu na Isirayila bɔxi ma, naxan xili Boosu. A fatan Elimeleki xabilɛ nan na. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Ruti Mowabaka naxa a fala Nowemi bɛ, «N wama sigafe xɛ ma funden maniyɛ dɔnxɔɛe matongode. Tɛmunde n xɛ kanyi nde toma naxan hinnɛma n na.» Nowemi naxɛ, «Awa n ma mamadi, i n lima be.»<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Ruti naxa siga funden maniyɛ dɔnxɔɛe matongode xɛ walikɛe xanbi ra. Alatala naxa a ragiri, a xa a xun ti Boosu, Elimeleki xabilɛ mixi nde xa xɛ ra. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Na waxati Boosu nu baxi sode keli Bɛtɛlɛɛmu. A naxa a xa walikɛe xɛɛbu, «Wo nu wali, Alatala xa wo ratanga.» E naxa a ratin, «Amina, Alatala xa barakɛ fi i fan ma.» <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boosu naxa maxɔrinyi ti walikɛe xunyi ma, «Nde na na sungbutunyi ra?» <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />A naxa a yaabi, «Na sungbutunyi Mowabaka na a ra, naxan fa Nowemi matide keli Mowaba bɔxi ma. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />A mayandi nan ti a xa funden maniyɛ dɔnxɔɛe matongo walikɛe xanbi ra. Kafi a fa gɛɛsɛgɛ, han yakɔsi a na walife, fo a to a malabufe yi ki bage bun ma.»<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Na tɛmui Boosu naxa a fala Ruti bɛ, «N ma di, i tuli mati. I xa lu be n ma walikɛ ginɛe xanbi ra. Hali i mu siga xɛ gbɛtɛ ma funden maniyɛ dɔnxɔɛe matongode. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />E na siga xɛ naxan ma, i fan xa bira e fɔxɔ ra. N bara ɲungui lu n ma xɛmɛe ma, e naxa i tɔɔrɔ. Xa ye xɔli i suxu, i xa siga ye minde, walikɛe xa ye naxan saxi fɛɲɛ kui.»<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Ruti naxa a igoro bɔxi ma ɲɛlɛxinyi saabui ra, a fa a fala, «N tan, beka mu n na, kɔnɔ i bara hinnɛ n na. I hinnɛxi n na munfe ra?» <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boosu naxa a yaabi, «Mixie bara a fala n bɛ, i naxan nabaxi i mama bɛ kafi i xa mɔri naxa faxa. E naxɛ, i bara i baba yo, i nga yo, nun i baride, i bara a birin bɛɲin, i fa siga mixie xɔnyi i mu dɛnnaxɛ kolon. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Ala xa i baraayi. Isirayila Marigi Ala xa i sare rakamali, i xaxili tixi Marigi naxan na.» <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Ruti naxa a fala Boosu bɛ, «N ma mangɛ, i bara hinnɛ n na, i bara nde ba n ma tɔɔrɛ ra. I xa wɔyɛnyi bara so n tan i xa konyi bɔɲɛ kui, na binyɛ gbo n tan bɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />E dɛge waxati Boosu naxa a fala Ruti bɛ, «Fa be, i xa taami nun bɔrɛ nde don.» Ruti naxa dɔxɔ walikɛe fɛ ma. Boosu naxa funden maniyɛ gilinxi nde so a yi ra. A naxa na don han a luga, a fa a dɔnxɔɛ ragata. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />A man to siga funden maniyɛ matongode, Boosu naxa yaamari fi a xa walikɛe ma. A naxɛ, «Hali a so a xabatare fan xɔɔra, wo naxa sɔnxɔ a ma. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Wo na funden maniyɛ raxiri, wo xa nde lu naa, a xa na fan matongo. Hali wo mu sese fala a bɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Ruti naxa wali han nunmare. A to gɛ walide, a naxa funden maniyɛ bɔnbɔ, a konbo ya firin nan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Ruti to so na birin na taa kui, a naxa a masen Nowemi bɛ. A donse naxan don Boosu yire, a naxa na dɔnxɔɛ fan so Nowemi yi ra. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Nowemi naxa Ruti maxɔrin, «I walixi xɛ mundun ma to? I yi funden maniyɛ matongoxi minden? Ala xa na mixi baraayi naxan hinnɛxi i ra.» Ruti naxa a birin ya maxaran a mama bɛ. A man naxa a fala, «Mixi naxan n malixi, a xili nɛ Boosu.» <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Nowemi naxa a fala a xa di xa ginɛ bɛ, «Ala xa a baraayi, Ala naxan mu a xa saatɛ fanyi kanama, a fa hinnɛ a xa mixie ra naxee na duniɲa a nun naxee na aligiyama. Yi xɛmɛ lanxi won xabilɛ mixi nde nan ma. Won xabilɛ ratangama nan a ra.»<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Ruti Mowabaka naxa a yaabi, «Na xɛmɛ naxɛ, a n xa wakili a xa walikɛe fɔxɔ ra han funden maniyɛ xabɛ xa ba a ra.» <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Nowemi naxa a fala a xa di xa ginɛ bɛ, «N ma di, a lanma i xa bira a xa walikɛ ginɛe fɔxɔ ra, alako mixi yo naxa i tɔɔrɔ xɛ gbɛtɛe ma.»<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Na kui Ruti naxa lu Boosu xa walikɛ ginɛe fɔxɔ ra han funden maniyɛ nun mɛngi maniyɛ xabɛ naxa ɲɔn. Ruti sabati Nowemi xɔnyi, na ki nɛ.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ruti nun Boosu xa lanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Nowemi naxa a fala a xa di xa ginɛ bɛ, a naxɛ, «Ruti, n wama i xa xɛmɛ taa fanyi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />I a kolon, Boosu, i sa walixi naxan xɔnyi nun a xa walikɛ ginɛe ra, won xabilɛ nan a ra. To nunmare ra, Boosu sigama lonyi ma funden maniyɛ bɔnbɔde. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />I naxan nabama, i xa i yailan a fanyi ra. I xa i maxa, i labundɛ sa i ma, i i maxiri dugi fanyi ra. Na tɛmui i xa siga lonyi yire. I i ya manɔxun Boosu ma han a xa gɛ a dɛgede. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />A na so a sade, i xa a mato a saxi dɛnnaxɛ. A na xi, i xa a xa dugi ba a sanyie ma, i i sa a san labe ra. A fama i rabafe falade i bɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Ruti naxa a yaabi, «Awa, n a birin nabama nɛ alɔ i a falaxi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Na tɛmui Ruti naxa siga na lonyi ma. A mama naxan falaxi a bɛ, a naxa na raba. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boosu to gɛ a dɛgede, a naxa a sa funden maniyɛ kuruxi fɛ ma ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. Ruti naxa a maso a ra dɔyin dɔyin, a dugi ba a sanyie ma, a fa a sa a san labe ra. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Kɔɛ tagi, Boosu naxa xunu, a naxa ginɛ to a san labe ra. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />A naxa a maxɔrin, «Nde a ra?» Ruti naxa a yaabi, «I xa konyi nan n na. N xili Ruti. N faxi nɛ, xa i nɔma n futide, barima muxu xabilɛ ratangama na i ra.»<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boosu naxa a masen a bɛ, «N ma di, Ala xa i baraayi. Yi hinnɛ fan i xa hinnɛ singe bɛ, barima i mu sigaxi sɛgɛtala se kanyi fɔxɔ ra, i mu sigaxi sɛgɛtala setare fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />N ma di, xanmɛri yo naxa lu i yi ra. N a birin nabama nɛ i bɛ i naxan maxɔrinxi, barima ɲama birin a kolon ginɛ fanyi nan i ra. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />I bara nɔndi fala. N tan, wo xabilɛ ratangama nan n na, kɔnɔ xabilɛ ratangama gbɛtɛ na naxan makɔrɛ i ra n tan bɛ. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Kɔɛ radangi be to. Gɛɛsɛgɛ, xa na mixi tin i ratangade, awa. Xa a mu tin, n tan i ratangama nɛ. N bara n kali Alatala ra! I xa xi be han kuye xa iba.»<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ruti naxa a sa Boosu san labe ra han subaxɛ ma. A naxa keli beenun soge xa te, barima Boosu mu nu wama mixi xa a kolon yi ginɛ nu na lonyi ma. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «I xa mafelenyi tongo, a dɛ suxu.» Ruti to a xa mafelenyi dɛ suxu, Boosu naxa funden maniyɛ konbo ya keren sa a kui. Boosu naxa Ruti rate na kote ma, Ruti fa siga taa kui.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />A naxa gbilen a mama Nowemi xɔnyi. Nowemi naxa a maxɔrin, «N ma mamadi, fe bara dangi a fanyi ra?» Ruti naxa a ya maxaran Boosu naxan birin nabaxi a bɛ. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />A naxɛ, «A bara yi funden maniyɛ konbo ya keren fi n ma. A naxɛ n bɛ, ‹I mu gbilenma i mama xɔnyi i bɛlɛxɛ igeli.›» <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Nowemi naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ma mamadi, i xa lu be han won xa a kolon yi fe raɲɔnma ki naxɛ. Na xɛmɛ mu a raxarama, fo yi fe xa yailan to yati nɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boosu Ruti futife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boosu naxa siga taa naadɛ ra, taakae malanma dɛnnaxɛ, a dɔxɔ. Na xabilɛ ratangama, Boosu nu naxan xa fe falama, na naxa fa. Boosu naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ba, fa i magoro be.» A naxa fa, a dɔxɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boosu man naxa a fala taa kuntigi fu bɛ, «Wo fa, wo wo magoro be.» E to dɔxɔ, <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boosu naxa a masen na xabilɛ ratangama bɛ, «Nowemi, naxan kelixi Mowaba, a wama Elimeleki xa bɔxi matife. I a kolon, Elimeleki won taara na a ra. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />N nu wama i xa kolon sɔtɔ na fe ma, i xa na bɔxi xun sara taakae nun taa kuntigie ya xɔri. Xa i nɔma a xun sarade, i xa a raba. Xa i mu nɔma na ra, a fala n bɛ, alako n xa a kolon, barima mixi gbɛtɛ mu nɔma a xun sarade fo i xa i xui fi. N tan nan i xanbi ra.» Na xɛmɛ naxa a yaabi, «N a xun sarama nɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Na tɛmui Boosu naxa yi wɔyɛnyi sa na fari, a naxɛ, «I nɛ yi bɔxi sarama lɔxɔɛ naxɛ Nowemi nun Ruti Mowabaka ma, i man xa na kaaɲɛ ginɛ fan dɔxɔ, alako faxamixi xili naxa lɔɛ na bɔxi xun ma.» <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Na xabilɛ ratangama naxa a yaabi, «Na kui n mu nɔma a xun sarade, xa na mu a ra n yɛtɛ kɛ kanama nɛ. I xa a xun sara, n tan mu nɔma.» <verse eid="RUT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Singe ra Isirayila bɔxi ma, xa mixi nde nu wama lanyi xirife, fo a xa sankiri ba, a xa a so a boore yi ra. Na nan a masenma lanyi bara gɛ xiride. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Na kui, na xabilɛ ratangama to a fala Boosu bɛ, «I xa na bɔxi xun sara i yɛtɛ bɛ,» a naxa a xa sankiri ba, a a so Boosu yi ra.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Na dangi xanbi Boosu naxa a masen taa kuntigie nun ɲama bɛ, «Wo bara findi seedee ra to. Elimeleki, Kilɔn, nun Maxalɔn xa see, n bara e birin sara Nowemi ma. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Maxalɔn xa ginɛ, Ruti Mowabaka, n bara na fan dɔxɔ alako faxamixi xili naxa lɔɛ a xa bɔxi xun ma, a xabilɛ nun a xa taa mixie naxa nɛɛmu a xa fe ma. To wo bara findi yi fe seedee ra.» <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Ɲama nun kuntigie naxa a yaabi, «Muxu bara tin findide seedee ra! Muxu bara Alatala maxandi yi ginɛ bɛ naxan sofe i xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:11">Alatala xa a lu alɔ Raxele nun Leya naxee bara die sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:11">e findi Isirayila ɲama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:11">Alatala xa sɛnbɛ fi i ma Efarata xabilɛ ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:11">Alatala xa xili xungbe fi i ma Bɛtɛlɛɛmu taa kui.<verse eid="RUT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Alatala xa di gbegbe fi i ma yi sungbutunyi saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:12">Alatala xa wo xa die findi denbaya ra alɔ Peresi xa denbaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:12">Peresi naxan Tamari barixi Yuda bɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Na tɛmui, Boosu naxa Ruti xa futi xiri. E to lu yire keren, Alatala naxa a ragiri Ruti xa tɛgɛ, a di sɔtɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Na kui ginɛe naxa a fala Nowemi bɛ, «Ala tantu, barima Alatala bara xabilɛ ratangama fi i ma. Isirayilakae xa tantui rasiga Ala ma! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Yi di fama mɛɛnide i ma, a i kantama i xa ɲɛlɛxɛforiɲa kui. I xa mamadi Ruti, naxan yi di sɔtɔxi i bɛ, a fan i xanuma, a tide gbo i bɛ dangi di solofere ra.»<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Nowemi naxa na diyɔrɛ tongo, a a sa a kanke ma, a findi a mɛɛnima ra. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Nowemi dɔxɔboore ginɛe naxa xili sa yi diyɔrɛ xun ma, a falafe ra, «Nowemi bara di sɔtɔ, a xili Obedo.» Obedo xa di nan Yisayi ra. Yisayi xa di nan Dawuda ra.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Peresi xa taruxui nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:18">Peresi naxa Heseron sɔtɔ.<verse eid="RUT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Heseron naxa Rami sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:19">Rami naxa Aminadabo sɔtɔ.<verse eid="RUT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabo naxa Naxason sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:20">Naxason naxa Salimon sɔtɔ.<verse eid="RUT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salimon naxa Boosu sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:21">Boosu naxa Obedo sɔtɔ.<verse eid="RUT 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedo naxa Yisayi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:22">Yisayi naxa Dawuda sɔtɔ.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>